    '. Licença ISC.': ['. ISC license.', '. Licencia ISC.'],
    'Roboto, Dancing Script, Pacifico, Great Vibes, Baloo 2, Caveat e Liberation Sans (SIL Open Font License) e DejaVu Sans (licença Bitstream Vera).': ['Roboto, Dancing Script, Pacifico, Great Vibes, Baloo 2, Caveat and Liberation Sans (SIL Open Font License) and DejaVu Sans (Bitstream Vera license).', 'Roboto, Dancing Script, Pacifico, Great Vibes, Baloo 2, Caveat y Liberation Sans (SIL Open Font License) y DejaVu Sans (licencia Bitstream Vera).'],
    'Arial e Verdana são fontes proprietárias: na tela, o aplicativo usa as do seu aparelho; nos PDFs, usa Liberation Sans e DejaVu Sans, que têm o mesmo desenho geral.': ['Arial and Verdana are proprietary fonts: on screen, the app uses the ones on your device; in PDFs, it uses Liberation Sans and DejaVu Sans, which have the same general design.', 'Arial y Verdana son fuentes propietarias: en pantalla, la aplicación usa las de tu dispositivo; en los PDF, usa Liberation Sans y DejaVu Sans, que tienen el mismo diseño general.'],
    'O campo Versão é seu: mude quando quiser. Ele aparece no rodapé e fica guardado no cadastro.': ['The Version field is yours: change it whenever you like. It appears in the footer and is kept in the collection.', 'El campo Versión es tuyo: cámbialo cuando quieras. Aparece en el pie y queda guardado en el recetario.'],
